      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768061919000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Linda. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768061928600000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Linda, I'm calling about an order. I need to return some shoes I bought a while back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16536,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768061933200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Do you have your order number?",
