      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768061939266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep, it's VF-8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16536,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768061943866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Great, let me pull that up... Okay, I see the Velo-Stride running shoes, delivered about two months ago. You're still well within the **90 days** for a return, so that is **no problem** at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768061945466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, fantastic! I wasn't sure if I'd missed the window. That's a relief.",
