      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16536,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768061958533332
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I see you're a VIP member with us, so I've gone ahead and processed that for you. I'm emailing the prepaid **return label** as we speak. I've also added a $20 credit to your account for your next purchase as a thank you for being such a great customer.",
